m not all knowing and can't think of every angle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did say mostly made up. You've shown us the list and everything.<br /> <br /> But I left out the 'add a gameline to an era' people because they don't even know what eras are available until the resurrect an era that lost people pick theirs, so clearly your list may change. Since those polls are over, though, the resurrectionists have got their options narrowed down.<br /> <br /> Have people been insisting you add someone to something? Aside from wyrdhamster's post, I mean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T15:07:55-07:00","id":1126067,"title":"","content":"Hmm...I wonder about when we'll learn about the mystery gamelines.<br /> <br /> Looking back at the DE1 KS, they only revealed what got backer expansions and what were the backer-resurrected eras much later: 1 month after the KS ended for DE1, 2 months for DEC1. So not an immense stretch of time, but still hefty. <br /> <br /> Granted the circumstances here for DE2 are a bit...different. Since the bulk of the Stretch Goal voting was on Eras but not on the gamelines attached to them. And has been noted multiple times in this and the regular DE2 thread, the backers who the expansion and resurrection slots, they can't reasonably make their decisions until they know what gamelines are going to the Stretch Goal Eras. So who knows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T18:30:19-07:00","id":1126132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1126010#post1126010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If that happens before we choose expansion. It may not. We'll have to see.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'll doubt it will be that chaotic, that could lead to People choose the same era with the same splat and other odd thiings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T18:48:27-07:00","id":1126137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1125782#post1125782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once again I shall plug beast/inferno satanic panic 80s for era creator</div> </div> </div> </div>I would like to second this plugging. I like the idea of Beasts getting hunted to near-extinction by Heroes in a setting where such witch-hunts are normalized, while the <i>real</i> big bad guys are laughing it up in Wall Street and spreading the prosperity gospel to get more and more. Not to mention the crack epidemic of the 80s and the enviroment of fear brought on by the Cold War in full swing.<br /> <br /> I just hope that an era creator who hasn't yet decided also finds the idea interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-08T08:03:34-07:00","id":1126310,"title":"","content":"I will mention again that Mongolian Empire would be fantastic as a created setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:01:09-07:00","id":1128666,"title":"","content":"Some of the ideas I had for an expansion are being discarded, as I have to prioritize which Era I want to see the most. Unfortunately it is not a perfect world so my pitches for the following probably will never be officially sanctioned.<ul><li>Heresy of the Flame (Promethean in the Light of the Sun, Europe 1600s)</li> <li>Dreams of the Desert (Changeling in 1001 Nights)</li> <li>Echoes of Antiquity (Beast in the Shadows of the 7 Wonders)</li> <li>Disrupting Designs (Demon in the 7 Wonders)</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:52:28-07:00","id":1128682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128666#post1128666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of the ideas I had for an expansion are being discarded, as I have to prioritize which Era I want to see the most. Unfortunately it is not a perfect world so my pitches for the following probably will never be officially sanctioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you pick the create your own era?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T20:00:23-07:00","id":1128686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128666#post1128666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of the ideas I had for an expansion are being discarded, as I have to prioritize which Era I want to see the most. Unfortunately it is not a perfect world so my pitches for the following probably will never be officially sanctioned.<ul><li>Heresy of the Flame (Promethean in the Light of the Sun, Europe 1600s)</li> <li>Dreams of the Desert (Changeling in 1001 Nights)</li> <li>Echoes of Antiquity (Beast in the Shadows of the 7 Wonders)</li> <li>Disrupting Designs (Demon in the 7 Wonders)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Are those the ones that you've narrowed down to? Those all seem like great ideas to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T21:16:54-07:00","id":1128703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128666#post1128666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of the ideas I had for an expansion are being discarded, as I have to prioritize which Era I want to see the most. Unfortunately it is not a perfect world so my pitches for the following probably will never be officially sanctioned.<ul><li>Heresy of the Flame (Promethean in the Light of the Sun, Europe 1600s)</li> <li>Dreams of the Desert (Changeling in 1001 Nights)</li> <li>Echoes of Antiquity (Beast in the Shadows of the 7 Wonders)</li> <li>Disrupting Designs (Demon in the 7 Wonders)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>That's a crazy hard pick. I'm no Beast fan, but I feel like that game's redemption could easily be in a Hellenic setting (Begotten-as-Furies is a solid idea, and you have some of the most mythically resonant monsters ever then), but I think it's criminal for a 1600s Europe setting possibly already centered on Rudolf's court to not have the Golem in it. I personally feel like Demon is the weakest link of the bunch?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T21:38:34-07:00","id":1128708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128703#post1128703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's a crazy hard pick. I'm no Beast fan, but I feel like that game's redemption could easily be in a Hellenic setting (Begotten-as-Furies is a solid idea, and you have some of the most mythically resonant monsters ever then), but I think it's criminal for a 1600s Europe setting possibly already centered on Rudolf's court to not have the Golem in it. I personally feel like Demon is the weakest link of the bunch?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Demon is the Strongest of the bunch, but that's just me. Demons and Changelings are both oath-binders, Demons and Prometheans have overlapping aesthetics, and the interaction of the Seven Wonders with Infrastructure is highly resonant. My inclination would be to go with Demon or Promethean. But all four are awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T03:40:23-07:00","id":1128748,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128686#post1128686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are those the ones that you've narrowed down to? Those all seem like great ideas to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Other way around I am afraid....those are the ones I pretty sure I am dropping from my potential suggestions.<br /> Allow me to clarify.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Era Expansions I want but can't do</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><ul><li>Heresy of the Flame (Promethean in the Light of the Sun, Europe 1600s)</li> <li>Dreams of the Desert (Changeling in 1001 Nights)</li> <li>Echoes of Antiquity (Beast in the Shadows of the 7 Wonders)</li> <li>Disrupting Designs (Demon in the 7 Wonders)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 08-14-2017, 07:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T08:00:17-07:00","id":1128822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128666#post1128666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of the ideas I had for an expansion are being discarded, as I have to prioritize which Era I want to see the most. Unfortunately it is not a perfect world so my pitches for the following probably will never be officially sanctioned.<ul><li>Heresy of the Flame (Promethean in the Light of the Sun, Europe 1600s)</li> <li>Dreams of the Desert (Changeling in 1001 Nights)</li> <li>Echoes of Antiquity (Beast in the Shadows of the 7 Wonders)</li> <li>Disrupting Designs (Demon in the 7 Wonders)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div> What does that leave?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T08:01:22-07:00","id":1128823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128748#post1128748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Other way around I am afraid....those are the ones I pretty sure I am dropping from my potential suggestions.<br /> Allow me to clarify.[/LIST]</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I see. That is a pity, but it does make me curious as to the ones still being considered. If these are the ones that have already been removed from your list of potentials, I'm sure the ones still on it must be solid gold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T08:14:29-07:00","id":1128828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1128822#post1128822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What does that leave?</div> </div> </div> </div>Goddamn awesomeness.<br /> <br /> (I've seen Eco's list of potential eras. I won't spoil it, but I am gleeful happy to get any one of these expansions).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T16:46:20-07:00","id":1129020,"title":"","content":"Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13726-world-s-first-ghost","name":"World's First Ghost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T16:58:30-07:00","id":1129025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>World's First Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129020#post1129020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>My go-to gamelines for crepuscolar atmospheres tend to be Vampire, Changeling, Promethean and Geist. Since my first pick for Steamboat is Promethean and you already have it in mind, I think I'd narrow it down to one of the other three. They all fit the Southern Gothic vibe and I think that it all depends on you.<br /> <br /> The three lines all explore different shades of it better than the others, with Vampire representing the undeath resonating with the end of an Era, Changeling the bittersweet tones and Geist the love for life and having to deal with the heavy baggage of the past that haunts people.<br /> <br /> Beast can do crepuscolar too (well, all gamelines can do anything, but you get my point), but that's more of a romantic &quot;me against the world&quot; than anything, not to mention you don't care much about it, so I won't even suggest it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 08-14-2017, 08:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T17:17:46-07:00","id":1129035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>World's First Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129020#post1129020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think, we're it me, it would depend somewhat on the other splat combinations. Promethean and Geist would work well. Promethean and Demon have the whole Angel/Quashmal thing (and could tie into the Industrial and Frontier aspect of it). Steamboats seem a little transient for the territorial minded Werewolves and Beasts, to me, but they could work. Mummy is hard to fit in (and would probably better fit another era with Promethean better), but I can see a few stories in that vein.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T17:20:52-07:00","id":1129037,"title":"","content":"Not doing Beast for Mississippi Steamboats might be fine anyways, since we would be double-dipping a bit due to A Fearful Lesson's existence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T17:24:01-07:00","id":1129038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129037#post1129037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not doing Beast for Mississippi Steamboats might be fine anyways, since we would be double-dipping a bit due to A Fearful Lesson's existence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a wrong point to bring up, actually","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T17:26:57-07:00","id":1129042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>World's First Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129020#post1129020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, <i>Memphis</i> is on the Mississippi... I'm really curious to see what notes writers would hit with Mummy, apart from the obvious ones (Nile analogue, slave trade-shuankhsen hooks).<br /> That, and I'm interested to see someone tackle Mummy/Promethean crossover.<br /> <br /> As for other options, Cinder's picks look pretty appealing too.<br /> I'm just happy to see you decided to save Steamboats. I'm sure whichever you choose will have some interesting possibilities to explore.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9596-almacov","name":"Almacov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T18:05:01-07:00","id":1129056,"title":"","content":"My big suggestion would be to do a crossover that hasn't been seen yet. While I have my biases (particularly towards Mummy) I don't think you can really go wrong here. Here's a list of them. The stars represent eras we technically have seen before, but the rules didn't really interact, so I'm not counting them. I've excluded Mage and Beast since you said you have no interest in them.<br /> <br /> Vampire - Werewolf<br /> Vampire - Promethean*<br /> Vampire - Changeling*<br /> Vampire - Hunter<br /> Vampire - Geist<br /> Vampire - Mummy<br /> Vampire - Deviant<br /> Werewolf - Promethean<br /> Werewolf - Changeling<br /> Werewolf - Hunter<br /> Werewolf - Mummy<br /> Werewolf - Demon<br /> Werewolf - Deviant<br /> Promethean - Hunter<br /> Promethean - Geist<br /> Promethean - Mummy<br /> Promethean - Demon<br /> Promethean - Deviant<br /> Changeling - Hunter<br /> Changeling - Geist*<br /> Changeling - Mummy<br /> Changeling - Demon<br /> Changeling - Deviant<br /> Hunter - Geist<br /> Hunter - Demon<br /> Hunter - Deviant<br /> Mummy - Demon<br /> Mummy - Deviant<br /> Demon - Deviant","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T18:41:34-07:00","id":1129073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129056#post1129056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My big suggestion would be to do a crossover that hasn't been seen yet. While I have my biases (particularly towards Mummy) I don't think you can really go wrong here. Here's a list of them. The stars represent eras we technically have seen before, but the rules didn't really interact, so I'm not counting them. I've excluded Mage and Beast since you said you have no interest in them.<br /> <br /> Vampire - Werewolf<br /> Vampire - Promethean*<br /> Vampire - Changeling*<br /> Vampire - Hunter<br /> Vampire - Geist<br /> Vampire - Mummy<br /> Vampire - Deviant<br /> Werewolf - Promethean<br /> Werewolf - Changeling<br /> Werewolf - Hunter<br /> Werewolf - Mummy<br /> Werewolf - Demon<br /> Werewolf - Deviant<br /> Promethean - Hunter<br /> Promethean - Geist<br /> Promethean - Mummy<br /> Promethean - Demon<br /> Promethean - Deviant<br /> Changeling - Hunter<br /> Changeling - Geist*<br /> Changeling - Mummy<br /> Changeling - Demon<br /> Changeling - Deviant<br /> Hunter - Geist<br /> Hunter - Demon<br /> Hunter - Deviant<br /> Mummy - Demon<br /> Mummy - Deviant<br /> Demon - Deviant</div> </div> </div> </div>My personal biases are towards Mummy/Vampire and Promethean/Demon, personally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T19:07:07-07:00","id":1129078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129056#post1129056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <i>A bunch of crossover possibilities</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Hm. let me think for a few I might like to see on that.<ul><li>Vampire - Geist: Bronze Age Collapse. As society in the Mediterranean is collapsing, the Bound struggle to keep the flood of Sea People, a mysterious army of ghosts from the Ocean Below, from pouring in full force into the living world, while the Kindred struggle to maintain what little power they can as society crumbles in chaos. What could be compelling the Sea People to flee the Underworld in such numbers? And why do some ghosts speak of terrible &quot;Birds of Dis?&quot;</li> <li>Vampire - Mummy: Honestly, I don't know if it needs an era, but I like to toy with the idea of an Elder who was present for the fall of Irem, and since Fog of Ages seems to no longer be a thing, that could make such an Elder a very interesting factor in a Mummy game, especially if they knew one of the mummies personally. Could this profane, hollow imitation of the Deathless be the key to unlocking your past? And how much is truth, and how much lies?</li> <li>Promethean - Geist: I would have actually made the Dust Bowl Promethean/Geist if I could have. Depression-era Sin-Eaters just feels <i>right</i> to me. A travelling Bound snake-oil salesman who moonlights as an exorcist, only to encounter another travelling snake-oil salesman, whose snake-oil happens to actually be his own alchemical bodily fluids!</li> <li>Promethean - Demon: I already said it before, but Book of Exodus feels like the one. Placing the God-Machine and the Principle in a game of chess that neither even seems to know it is playing, with Demons, Prometheans, and the Hebrews caught in the middle. And according to both the Angels and the Qashmallim, neither side seems to be directing Moses...</li> <li>Hunter - Deviant - Demon : Cold War seems like the place. I'd actually make the Cold War Demon/Hunter/Deviant. Demons on both sides of the conflict trying to manipulate things to reach their Hell, either by winning with one side, trying to push the world into a nuclear apocalypse to bring the God-Machine down by force, or just trying to make sure things stay where they are. In the meantime, the Demons have been using Stigmatic operatives, as they always have, but they've enountered...other agents. Some were expected. Most Agencies have been aware of groups like America's Valkyrie and VASCU, and the Russian Tenburo, but there seem to be other, less-known quantities becoming involved, that could threaten to throw the balance of power out the window.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T20:34:58-07:00","id":1129093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>World's First Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129020#post1129020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would point out that we have nice setting elements for two gamelines that would be cool to update and show in 'earlier days' - in <b>Vampire</b>, we have whole city of New Orleans as official setting, not touched since from 1E <b>Damnation City </b>book. As <i>Interview with Vampire</i> fan ( and general <i>Vampires Chronicles )</i>, I really would love to see the city in 19<sup>th</sup> century, with it's independance from rest of USA ( as just ended French colony ), plantations, Voodoo and now coming electricity. Just I point you to this cool scene from 1994 movie...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mBg4aL95J3k\" data-code=\"mBg4aL95J3k\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/mBg4aL95J3k/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> ( By the way, we are waiting for the <i>Vampire Chronicles</i> TV series now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> Other gameline is <b>Changeling</b> - to that we were <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/tumbledown-market-changeling-the-lost/\" target=\"_blank\">'just' having spoiled that New Orleans is Greatest Goblin Market in USA ( with Courts based on Coins and Trade )</a> and at mystical crossroads of Hedge in America, somehow very Gaiman's <i>Neverwhere-</i>style. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Both are interesting settings to me o explore with Steamboats Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T20:37:57-07:00","id":1129095,"title":"","content":"What two gamelines would you stick in a Jewish revolt Era, set in Roman Judea?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T20:51:39-07:00","id":1129097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129095#post1129095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What two gamelines would you stick in a Jewish revolt Era, set in Roman Judea?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd probably go Mage and Promethean personally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T20:58:29-07:00","id":1129098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129025#post1129025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My go-to gamelines for crepuscolar atmospheres tend to be Vampire, Changeling, Promethean and Geist. Since my first pick for Steamboat is Promethean and you already have it in mind, I think I'd narrow it down to one of the other three. They all fit the Southern Gothic vibe and I think that it all depends on you.<br /> <br /> The three lines all explore different shades of it better than the others, with Vampire representing the undeath resonating with the end of an Era, Changeling the bittersweet tones and Geist the love for life and having to deal with the heavy baggage of the past that haunts people.<br /> <br /> Beast can do crepuscolar too (well, all gamelines can do anything, but you get my point), but that's more of a romantic &quot;me against the world&quot; than anything, not to mention you don't care much about it, so I won't even suggest it</div> </div> </div> </div>I like these ideas a lot. Unfortunately, since we're already getting Promethean/Changeling with 7 Wonders, I might have to rule that out. Promethean/Geist would be a dream for me since they're my two favorites, but Vampire is a really strong choice, too. I've always been a little partial to Vampire in this time period, but I've been hesitant since Vampire/Promethean already happened with the Black Death chapter in DEC. But as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> pointed out, that wasn't a true crossover era, so I think we're good.<br /> <br /> I guess it's ultimately up to the devs, but I'll definitely have to share all this with them when the time comes!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13726,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13726-world-s-first-ghost","user":"World's First Ghost","date":". 08-15-2017, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13726-world-s-first-ghost","name":"World's First Ghost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T00:01:47-07:00","id":1129132,"title":"","content":"I have three primary Eras I am considering and one that exists only as a back up, (mostly because I don't want to turf it). Basically, if I can't sum up why it would awesome to have the Era and how we can get a heap of storyhooks and ideas from that crossover in THAT time period in particular, then it didn't make it. More arbitrarily, I'm not going to expand an Era that is already getting expanded or try to add the same gameline to more than one Era or the same Era two different lines. Hence why Promethean in Light of the Sun was cut. (I am considering another Era that I feel is a better fit for a Pilgrimage story and the setting. Double tapped).<br /> <br /> The remaining eras I am considering adding to include the French Revolution, the Promethean one and Light of the Sun. With a wild card backup I am really tring not go forward because I am...less than versed on the period in question, amongst other reasons.<br /> <br /> So unfortunately I can't do all the lovely ideas. I guess we won't get to see some of them. On the other hand, I am willing to share some of my pitches with the other expanders, in the hopes they might get adopted. The reason I am being intentionally vague now is the Onyx Path legal requirements. Remember, if I share details in public, the writers can't use the ideas.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T01:53:14-07:00","id":1129147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129132#post1129132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have three primary Eras I am considering and one that exists only as a back up, (mostly because I don't want to turf it). Basically, if I can't sum up why it would awesome to have the Era and how we can get a heap of storyhooks and ideas from that crossover in THAT time period in particular, then it didn't make it. More arbitrarily, I'm not going to expand an Era that is already getting expanded or try to add the same gameline to more than one Era or the same Era two different lines. Hence why Promethean in Light of the Sun was cut. (I am considering another Era that I feel is a better fit for a Pilgrimage story and the setting. Double tapped).<br /> <br /> The remaining eras I am considering adding to include the French Revolution, the Promethean one and Light of the Sun. With a wild card backup I am really tring not go forward because I am...less than versed on the period in question, amongst other reasons.<br /> <br /> So unfortunately I can't do all the lovely ideas. I guess we won't get to see some of them. On the other hand, I am willing to share some of my pitches with the other expanders, in the hopes they might get adopted. The reason I am being intentionally vague now is the Onyx Path legal requirements. Remember, if I share details in public, the writers can't use the ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Understood, good luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T01:58:53-07:00","id":1129149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129035#post1129035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think, we're it me, it would depend somewhat on the other splat combinations. Promethean and Geist would work well. Promethean and Demon have the whole Angel/Quashmal thing (and could tie into the Industrial and Frontier aspect of it). Steamboats seem a little transient for the territorial minded Werewolves and Beasts, to me, but they could work. Mummy is hard to fit in (and would probably better fit another era with Promethean better), but I can see a few stories in that vein.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah Demon would be the Best fit for a Prommy Steam boat era, although the writer may have their own ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T04:38:51-07:00","id":1129179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129095#post1129095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What two gamelines would you stick in a Jewish revolt Era, set in Roman Judea?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean when the Masada Siege happened? I'd go with Mage or Demon, for war in the shadows, propaganda, ideals clashing and revolt against the &quot;Empire&quot; (with a nod to Philip K. Dick for that), plus Werewolf for territories, strong faiths that motivate to action and because the Shadow back there gives me interesting ideas that are not the classic &quot;the spirit world was a mess&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 08-15-2017, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T04:50:05-07:00","id":1129181,"title":"","content":"I would actually be more interested in the Bar Kokhba Revoult, as it was the one in which both the outcomes and the events which led to the two previous events has came into a climax, which ended with the last jewish independent state for the next 1800 years and has deeply influenced the jewish culture and society. Plus, it has Bar Kokhba, which I've always found as an interesting historical, controversial character","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T14:05:21-07:00","id":1129415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>World's First Ghost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1129020#post1129020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I'm not entirely sure when the backers are going to be asked for their eras/expansions and I'm still undecided about what splat I'd want to see in Mississippi alongside Promethean, I'm open to hear suggestions. It'll be hard to sell me on splats I don't care for like Mage or Beast, but I'd still like to hear all your ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire would be my pick. The veneer of the South's romantic cultural ideals built on the depredation of slavery, honour killings,family feuds and easily spread disease makes its an interesting setting for Vampire. You could do a lot of interesting things with the setting and Vampire's metaphors. I'd personally run it so that vampire society (mostly) tries to maintain the health of their blood dolls which makes them potentially morally superior to large portions of human slave owning society.<br /> <br /> Also how fantastic would it be to see Vampires and Prometheans interact with each other, in the context of humanity demonstrating its best and worst traits? New technology and ideas spreading against slavery and exploitation.<br /> <br /> Elder Vampire &quot;You really still want to become human? Look at what they do to each!&quot;<br /> Young Promethean &quot;You don't wish to become human? Look at what they create!&quot;<br /> Elder Vampire &quot;I guess steamboats are impressive.&quot;<br /> Young Promethean &quot;Toot! Toot!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1161-gravitas-man","name":"Gravitas Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1161_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T06:27:36-07:00","id":1130791,"title":"","content":"Listened today in Polish radio discussion about first centuries of Islam, so I have some points to it. If you go with <i>1001 Nights</i> expansion for Mage, <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/\" target=\"_blank\">Second Chances</a>, maybe point writer also to things - Era is in 750 till 1258 so it's all along creation and rose to power of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isma%27ilism\" target=\"_blank\">Ism\u0101\u02bf\u012blism</a> branch of Islam - group that have heavy connotations of Neoplatonism and Mystagogism in it's practices, both elements highly resonating with Orders. Their belief in Mahdi would nicely correlate with Guardians faith in Hieromagus.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Now seeing they are creators of Almut's power and Assasins, I see you wanted to include them from the begining. I just did not know that Hassan-i Sabbah was Ism\u0101\u02bf\u012blist. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Second, this period is till 1258 - and we know that Corpus Author in Byzantium joined Keepers of the Word and Panscryptiats in 12th century, so before the end of this Era. I know that Caliphates are not Eastern Roman Empire, but they are neighbors, so probably Misterium as unified Order started to spread in them before the end of 1001 Nights. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-18-2017, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T04:55:42-07:00","id":1131188,"title":"","content":"Also, in <i>1001 Nights</i> Mage expansion should be Panscryptias and Keepers of the Word splats write-ups, as Era is for the better part of their existing, till the end. Caliphates Diamond mages would have members of both Orders in them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-19-2017, 07:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:13:52-07:00","id":1131192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131188#post1131188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, in <i>1001 Nights</i> Mage expansion should be Panscryptias and Keepers of the Word splats write-ups, as Era is for the better part of their existing, till the end. Caliphates Diamond mages would have members of both Orders in them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they were the Pentacle at that time. Keepers, Cryptics, Arrows, Ladders and Guardians...After they are also the Pentacle....but the Soul of the Dragon is not yet here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:21:52-07:00","id":1131199,"title":"","content":"Pentacle is the name for the Diamond plus Free Council. The Diamond is called so due to the symbolism. Even when they were six orders (Panscryptias, Keepers and Tremere) instead of the modern four they were still called the Diamond so it has nothing to do with the number of orders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T05:46:18-07:00","id":1131218,"title":"","content":"They're named after the Silver Doctrine &quot;the Diamond Precept&quot; (&quot;the Awakened are one nation&quot; or in earlier times &quot;one people&quot;) not that there's four of them.<br /> <br /> The Pentacle *is* named after the fact that there's five of them, but it's only existed since 1901.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T06:30:15-07:00","id":1131235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131218#post1131218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're named after the Silver Doctrine &quot;the Diamond Precept&quot; (&quot;the Awakened are one nation&quot; or in earlier times &quot;one people&quot;) not that there's four of them.<br /> <br /> The Pentacle *is* named after the fact that there's five of them, but it's only existed since 1901.</div> </div> </div> </div>Noted Boss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T09:20:50-07:00","id":1131307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131192#post1131192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think they were the Pentacle at that time. Keepers, Cryptics, Arrows, Ladders and Guardians...After they are also the Pentacle....but the Soul of the Dragon is not yet here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, as <i>1001 Nights</i> is 750 - 1258 in years than even Tremere <b>go to <i>and out</i> </b>of the Diamond Orders union table. Both events are from <b>Left Hand Path</b> book ( quotes from <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/387074-history-of-awakened-mage-timeline\">Mage Timeline project</a>, based on <b>LHP</b> book ) :<br /> <br /> '<b>8th century AD: Tremere join Diamond - </b>In Eastern Europe, one or two Tremere demanded hospitality at Diamond wizards\u2019 towers. Quickly follow them whole cabals, showing carcasses of monsters they fought to assure good intentions. Tremere were warrior-sorcerers and students of the soul who promised to lead the Awakened to a new age of splendor, built on the ashes of burning enemies. They hunted Seers and Scelesti, but demand selected Reapers and vampires as tribute for the balance of their wrath. They preached that Atlantis\u2019s faithful willworkers were the natural lords of souls. Anyone who challenged their crowns deserved to burn. '<br /> <br /> '<b>1099:</b> <b>Banishment of Tremere</b> - Silver Ladder lictor Caterine Bedlam told the Convocation of Antioch what many now suspected: the Tremere was a Legacy of Reapers who hunted their own kind. It labeled them as Nefandi by Convocation, with banishment and \u2018forgetting\u2019 of Tremere Order members \u2013 their magical tools were destroyed, as any grimoires, soul stones, or imbued items they created. Their Shadow Name becomes illegal to utter and were replaced in all Consilium records by \u201cNefandi:\u201d the name that is not a name and cannot be spoken. As other Convocations followed move that of Antioch done, within few decades Tremere were officially excommunicated from Diamond be every European Convocations, becoming target for Reaper hunters they ones been.'<br /> <br /> So <i>1001 Nights</i> Mage expansions should do justice to 3 Diamond Orders by giving them in the splat write-ups: Panscryptias, Keepers of the World <b>and</b> Tremere Orders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-19-2017, 12:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T09:37:27-07:00","id":1131314,"title":"","content":"Well, the 3 Orders write-ups load can be much evenly split <i>IF</i> we get Arthurian Mage. Then Arthurian Britain should take Panscryptias and Keepers of the World splats pages ( as 'late Roman Mage' Era ) and <i>1001 Nights</i> expansion just add Tremere to it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Both Eras would be in the same <b>Dark Eras 2</b> ( main ) book, in the end. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It would be even <i>more fair</i>, with this as a case, as we know<b> Second Chances </b>wants to add 'correct' 2E Subtle Ones and Assasins to the Golden Age of Islam Era. It's even nicer, as Tremere sounds to look very 'orietal-ish' in Diamond and one is much less than three Orders to add as expansion. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-19-2017, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T11:12:23-07:00","id":1131360,"title":"","content":"Wyrd, just as the department of expectation management, I can tell you I'm not nearly as interested in Order writeups as you are, so it won't be part of my request. It could still happen, but only if the writers and developers decide that's how they want to use the space in the chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T15:47:08-07:00","id":1131483,"title":"","content":"Given the complexity of the template differences, I don't think we'll see the Tremere in DE2 short of a dedicated backer expansion (ie the entire word count)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T16:00:05-07:00","id":1131490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131483#post1131483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given the complexity of the template differences, I don't think we'll see the Tremere in DE2 short of a dedicated backer expansion (ie the entire word count)</div> </div> </div> </div>This is why I wish they had added more of these slots, because I'd gladly have backed at this level if I could get Tremere in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T16:55:04-07:00","id":1131515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131360#post1131360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wyrd, just as the department of expectation management, I can tell you I'm not nearly as interested in Order writeups as you are, so it won't be part of my request. It could still happen, but only if the writers and developers decide that's how they want to use the space in the chapter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just for further clarity on this, that doesn't mean I'm in anyway opposed to new Order writeups. I think they would be cool. They don't even rank close to what I'd want to see out of 1001 Nights, though, so I'm not specifically asking for them. If they make their way in anyhow, I'll enjoy it for what its worth. <br /> <br /> I do absolutely agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1624_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1624\" data-vbnamecard=\"1624\">FallenEco</a> though, I doubt the Tremere will be updated to 2e in DE2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T19:46:35-07:00","id":1131577,"title":"","content":"Bummer... \ud83d\ude15 I would be even glad for the Order sp\u0142at 2-3 page, not mechanics of Tremere - the idea of souls stealing ORDER is just too cool. Even if we would <i>not have</i> mechanics to run those more than NPCs for few next years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-19-2017, 11:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T20:16:19-07:00","id":1131584,"title":"","content":"I won't be Developing any era in DE2, and would be sceptical of anyone doing the Tremere rules in one. Especially as all the etas are crossovers. There just isn't enough room.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T21:52:37-07:00","id":1131614,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar14_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"14\" data-vbnamecard=\"14\">Dave Brookshaw</a>, as you are not doing any Dark Eras projects lately, I assume the quickest ( and best ) place to look for splats write-ups for Panscryptias, Keepers of the Word and Tremere Orders will be T<b>ome of Pentacle</b>?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> , I know you as backer wants to add your content to Mage expansion of <i>1001 Nights</i> - I just think you should mention in your talks with Mage Era part developer that in that time we had 6 Orders in Diamond. I'm worried dev ( especially outside of day-to-da Mage line ) can 'forget' that this was a case - as shown by <b>Fallen Eco</b> post ( and similar we seen on forum in last years ), it's a bit confusing topic and people from the outside can really forget it. And I mean nothing as 'you need to dedicate 3 pages per Order to get it whole write-up', but that when they will write Era, we did not see mentioning of Mysterium in 800's or that they miss Tremere as Order in Eras text. Just reminder to author, nothing more - so we would have truly coherent Mage 2E timeline as <b>Dave</b> envisioned it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T21:59:53-07:00","id":1131615,"title":"","content":"While those three orders might be mentioned in Tome of the Pentacle, the name of the book heavily implies that no, they won't get any details. The Pentacle is specifically the four modern Diamond orders and Free Council so anything else would be beyond the obvious scope of the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T22:04:21-07:00","id":1131619,"title":"","content":"All three Devs read these threads. I assume they will at least chat with Dave. It's not my job to remind them and my pitch is too long already. If you're that worried about it, I suggest you PM them or post to the comments on Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T22:26:34-07:00","id":1131621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131619#post1131619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All three Devs read these threads. I assume they will at least chat with Dave. It's not my job to remind them and my pitch is too long already. If you're that worried about it, I suggest you PM them or post to the comments on Kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will do if we will be confirmed we will finally settled for <i>Arthurian Britain</i> and <i>1001 Nights</i> for Mage - till this day it's more 'strongly probable' than anything sure. And still not know who will write those - I suppose that Mage parts would be for Matthew Dawkins, as he was interested in <b>MtAw</b> before?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T22:37:44-07:00","id":1131624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131621#post1131621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Will do if we will be confirmed we will finally settled for <i>Arthurian Britain</i> and <i>1001 Nights</i> for Mage - till this day it's more 'strongly probable' than anything sure. And still not know who will write those - I suppose that Mage parts would be for Matthew Dawkins, as he was interested in <b>MtAw</b> before?</div> </div> </div> </div>For <i>1001 Nights</i>...no. Meghan's the one who's writing that one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T08:08:07-07:00","id":1131716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131584#post1131584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I won't be Developing any era in DE2, and would be sceptical of anyone doing the Tremere rules in one. Especially as all the etas are crossovers. There just isn't enough room.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're not developing the Light of the Sun - Europe (1600s) era, the Mage / Deviant crossover, even though you're the developer for both lines? That's surprising. <br /> <br /> Are you at least writing large chunks of the era?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T10:31:59-07:00","id":1131775,"title":"","content":"Since everyone seems so surprised, if you look at the Kickstarter campaign page, you'll see very clearly, 'Shepherding the writing will be developers Monica Valentinelli, Matthew Dawkins, and Meghan Fitzgerald.' They are the ones who have been talking about all the Dark Eras, making posts alongside Rose the development producer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T11:19:19-07:00","id":1131795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131775#post1131775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since everyone seems so surprised, if you look at the Kickstarter campaign page, you'll see very clearly, 'Shepherding the writing will be developers Monica Valentinelli, Matthew Dawkins, and Meghan Fitzgerald.' They are the ones who have been talking about all the Dark Eras, making posts alongside Rose the development producer.</div> </div> </div> </div>They even say which eras they are working on in the introduction video. <br /> <br /> Monica - Qing Dynasty &amp; Light of the Sune<br /> Meghan - French Revolution &amp; 1001 Nights<br /> Matt - Great War &amp; Seven Ancient Wonders","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T13:43:47-07:00","id":1131863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131716#post1131716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You're not developing the Light of the Sun - Europe (1600s) era, the Mage / Deviant crossover, even though you're the developer for both lines? That's surprising. <br /> <br /> Are you at least writing large chunks of the era?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope! I expect Monica will be in touch at some point to find out what Deviant is about.<br /> <br /> Regarding the Tremere, the first ed Tremere section in Left Hand Path was longer than an unexpanded Dark Era; second ed Tremere are more complicated, no one involved has the background to do them, and they wouldn't fit into an era even with an expansion. We're looking at how we can get the Tremere, Mad, and Scelesti rules out, but Dark Eras really isn't the place for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:01:12-07:00","id":1131869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131863#post1131863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope! I expect Monica will be in touch at some point to find out what Deviant is about.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Based on your response, I assume Monica is not one of the authors on the upcoming Deviant corebook. She's further not credited on Mage 2e. Monica's also ironically the developer of Hunter, the singular CofD gameline where you have no writing credit.<br /> <br /> While I don't question Monica's general talent or dedication, I admit being a little apprehensive that the era will have sufficient depth and content without you or another significant Mage and/or Deviant author at the helm.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:05:47-07:00","id":1131871,"title":"","content":"The most obvious and simple (but not necessarily best) answer would be a Night Horros book similar to the upcoming Shunned by the Moon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:07:40-07:00","id":1131872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131871#post1131871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The most obvious and simple (but not necessarily best) answer would be a Night Horros book similar to the upcoming Shunned by the Moon.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Then Mage would have two Night Horrors books. I don't see that being approved any time soon, particularly when there's still a lot of new Mage 2e material to explore in supplements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:12:56-07:00","id":1131876,"title":"","content":"Mage wouldn't be the first gameline with two Night Horrors book, and unlike VtR they'd be spread across editions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:23:14-07:00","id":1131883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125289-dark-eras-2-backer-expansion-thread?p=1131876#post1131876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mage wouldn't be the first gameline with two Night Horrors book, and unlike VtR they'd be spread across editions.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What other line had two Night Horror books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","user":"branford","date":".  typo 08-20-2017, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T14:46:23-07:00","id":1131887,"title":"","content":"Vampire had two in first edition, Tessie's 'unlike VtR' was getting at that. Immortal Sinners was full of individual NPCs, with occasional mechanics like Devotions or Merits or Bloodlines they had. The Wicked Dead was in two parts, with Truth displaying various proto- and pseudo-vampires, and Consequences showing things that can be a result of vampire actions, Larvae, Draugr, Dampyr and Strix. Shunned by the Moon isn't likely going to be made anytime soon, but it's been approved of, so that would be the second Werewolf one as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-20-2017, 05:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T15:37:03-07:00","id":1131914,"title":"","content":"Forgot about Wolfsbane. Was forbidden to read it by my ST due to spoilers. As you said that would make Werewolf the second gameline with a Night Horrors book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.