t of context because I'm not saying the two lines it already has, but any thoughts on adding Demon to Hawara?</div> </div> </div> </div> Well you kind of gave away that demon ISN'T already one of the two lines for Hawara, although that isn't a shocker. <br /> <br /> I'm curious what you would do with demon in Hawara?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T19:04:53-07:00","id":1139603,"title":"","content":"See, this is why messaging each other is ok, but I'm less happy about talking about it in the fourms.<br /> <br /> As I said on the Group, you get ancient Egyptian Infrastructure, and more information about dealing with how [Redacted] interact and more insight into the likely conflicts between [Redacted]. Additionaly we could see how the splats feel about the local religion and how they differ. I imagine how the Unchained feel about Sobek is very different to how [Redacted] feel about the cult, which differes from how [Redacted] would feel, if 1E is anything to go by.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T20:58:06-07:00","id":1139624,"title":"","content":"*sees edited first post* <br /> <br /> Ok, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-